  "_about": "Which grammar task types a level uses (SPEC-grammar-tests.md, the 8 types) and how the content gate counts them. A new level is a data change: switch `enabled` on once its core topics have `minPerType` items of every type in `types`. The core topics are NOT listed here: they are the syllabus topics whose tier (GRAMMAR_TIER in lib/grammar/syllabus.ts) is one of `coreTiers`.",
